{"id":"UZ91Hn1hmVR2dYP","name":"medieval_npc_spawn","type":"sequence","entries":[{"id":"0ENHZ40MxLu7uci","name":"sound_during_medieval_talking","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"value":"music.overworld.badlands","type":"default"},"track":"RECORD","soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":""}},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"K4fLDSbmzviuWe6","name":"interact_with_npc","triggers":["0BFn7BwpkZ01BZG","kPYKF8FhhoPLl3M","nUXHlIk0mJQLoXu","CbSLAihWOkdfUGI","3WdM52wP7HkxHUw","jjw9Ic36E7UYRq0","jbomnvtnwDda5Vw","Cb27brLe0Vyhlr7","HiKRkf3hlrHsOaS"],"definition":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","shiftType":"ANY","interactionType":"ALL","type":"entity_interact_event","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"iOyHU9vrtp1HcBJ","name":"first_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"El último rincón en pie del Antiguo Imperio: unos muros, un rey cansado y un puñado de gente que se niega a rendirse. Más allá del portal, el mundo es tuyo… y peligroso.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"PfZXA4le9WpgCUW","name":"second_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Antes de vestir esta armadura forjaba espadas en una aldea del norte. Las criaturas de la noche la arrasaron. Desde entonces vigilo estos muros: es lo único que me queda.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"TNxe9YQeyLwJ1jx","name":"third_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"La tenía. Mi mujer, <#F86363>Elia</#F86363>, y mi hija, <#F86363>Nara</#F86363>. Nara tendría ahora más o menos tu edad… Las perdí la noche en que cayó la aldea. Por eso nadie sale de aquí con las manos vacías.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"kPYKF8FhhoPLl3M","name":"firsts_options","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[{"fact":"lb1ix6O6aDeGigd","operator":"=","value":1}],"triggers":[],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Vigía del Reino. ¿Qué necesitas, forastero?","options":[{"text":"<#7FD8FF>⛨ Proteger mi terreno","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["RdHtmHvLUbHdl0n"]},{"text":"¿Qué es este lugar?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["iOyHU9vrtp1HcBJ"]},{"text":"¿Quién eres tú?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["PfZXA4le9WpgCUW"]},{"text":"¿Tienes familia?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["TNxe9YQeyLwJ1jx"]},{"text":"¿Qué sabes del Rey Draemir?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["KLikJgOeR4tBwhk"]},{"text":"¿Algún consejo para sobrevivir?","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["McTCTMTFdFkMfXS"]},{"text":"¿Qué pasó la noche que lo perdiste todo?","criteria":[{"fact":"lb1ix6O6aDeGigd","operator":"==","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["eDwlmSnYOpDw5TR"]},{"text":"¿Por qué me ayudas tanto?","criteria":[{"fact":"lb1ix6O6aDeGigd","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"5PBbnm3NliqNT1N","operator":">=","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["ZNn6vLby9A8tu83"]},{"text":"Háblame de Elia y Nara","criteria":[{"fact":"5PBbnm3NliqNT1N","operator":">=","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["sT69eFQEBnipksq"]}],"duration":1000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"nUXHlIk0mJQLoXu","name":"stop_all_sounds_first_on_npc","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["0ENHZ40MxLu7uci"],"sound":{"enabled":false,"value":{"type":"default","value":""}},"type":"stop_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"KLikJgOeR4tBwhk","name":"lore_guardia_rey","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Es un buen rey, aunque guarda demasiados secretos. Desde que llegaste te mira distinto… como si te hubiera estado esperando toda la vida. No sé qué sabe de ti, pero confío en él.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"McTCTMTFdFkMfXS","name":"lore_guardia_consejo","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Nada de lo que lleves encima es para siempre; lo que aprendas, sí. Explora de día, refúgiate de noche y nunca salgas sin comida.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"CbSLAihWOkdfUGI","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_guardia","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":1}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#F86363>Guardia Real <dark_gray>» <#C9CDD6>*Te mira de arriba abajo.* El Rey quiere verte antes que nadie. No le hagas esperar.","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"3WdM52wP7HkxHUw","name":"tutorial_guardia_presentacion","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"<=","value":4}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["xpn23wSblag6BOD"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Así que tú eres el forastero que apareció junto al observatorio. El Rey me pidió que te preparara… y no pienso dejar que salgas ahí fuera con las manos vacías.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"xpn23wSblag6BOD","name":"tutorial_guardia_mision","criteria":[],"modifiers":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"=","value":6},{"fact":"lb1ix6O6aDeGigd","operator":"=","value":1},{"fact":"26auCJp8cHzlQEW","operator":"=","value":4}],"triggers":["JSugiYpCAK66OYT","7LjLAQhsf4thCFE","u5dUiZnj6CDJgnN"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Toma: un suit de cuero, herramientas de piedra, comida y una manzana dorada para los malos momentos. Y estas monedas: ahí fuera nadie regala nada. Tienes la edad que tendría mi hija… cuídate, ¿me oyes?","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"u5dUiZnj6CDJgnN","name":"tutorial_guardia_portal_fin","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["mRsHdRXfr8nBNXY"],"speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Ahora busca el <#5FE3FF>Portal</#5FE3FF>; el rastro blanco te llevará. Te lanzará a un lugar al azar del mundo. Cuando vuelvas, aquí estaré.","duration":1500,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"snggHrWyzjxXwFm","name":"tutorial_titulo_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"title":"<#5FE3FF>El Portal","subtitle":"<#C9CDD6>Crúzalo para salir al mundo","durations":{"enabled":true,"value":{"fadeIn":500,"stay":3500,"fadeOut":800}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"JSugiYpCAK66OYT","name":"tutorial_sonido_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"block.portal.ambient"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.5,"pitch":1.6},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"7LjLAQhsf4thCFE","name":"tutorial_consola_paso_6","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"tutorial paso %player_name% 6","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"jjw9Ic36E7UYRq0","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_guardia_portal","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#5FE3FF>✦ <#C9CDD6>Salta al <#5FE3FF>portal<#C9CDD6> para terminar","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"n8nOz27vGPuKaGm","name":"tutorial_suit_inicial","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"itemdar %player_name% 1 leather helmet\nitemdar %player_name% 1 leather chestplate\nitemdar %player_name% 1 leather leggings\nitemdar %player_name% 1 leather boots\nitemdar %player_name% 1 stone sword\nitemdar %player_name% 1 stone pickaxe\nitemdar %player_name% 1 stone axe\nitemdar %player_name% 32 cooked beef\nitemdar %player_name% 1 golden apple","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"SaWHGOKxG8pKHBJ","name":"tutorial_suit_monedas","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"amount":1000.0,"type":"deposit_balance","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"wJq13TcoKBzDPhY","name":"tutorial_titulo_suit","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"title":"<#FFD36B>Equipo Inicial","subtitle":"<#7FFF9E>+1000 monedas","durations":{"enabled":true,"value":{"fadeIn":400,"stay":3000,"fadeOut":600}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"D5nlo0Laa8nzFTk","name":"tutorial_sonido_suit","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"item.armor.equip_leather"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":1,"pitch":1},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"jbomnvtnwDda5Vw","name":"tutorial_bloqueo_guardia_eco","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"==","value":2}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"message":"<#F86363>Guardia Real <dark_gray>» <#C9CDD6>Tienes la mirada perdida, forastero. Ve al <#7FB2FF>Eco</#7FB2FF> y vuelve cuando recuerdes algo.","type":"action_bar_simple_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"mRsHdRXfr8nBNXY","name":"tutorial_cinematica_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["n8nOz27vGPuKaGm","SaWHGOKxG8pKHBJ","wJq13TcoKBzDPhY","D5nlo0Laa8nzFTk","CbvaQqrpxCCduFx","Fv3il5Qf5ORrK0t","7XA6qReaun3ztI6"],"blockChatMessages":true,"blockActionBarMessages":true,"page":"4vmuGMGKAuWfpTb","type":"cinematic","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"CbvaQqrpxCCduFx","name":"tutorial_suit_destello","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":false,"value":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"particle":"TOTEM_OF_UNDYING","count":40,"offset":{"x":0.4,"y":0.8,"z":0.4},"speed":0.35,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"Fv3il5Qf5ORrK0t","name":"tutorial_suit_chispas","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":false,"value":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"particle":"HAPPY_VILLAGER","count":20,"offset":{"x":0.5,"y":0.9,"z":0.5},"speed":0.1,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"Cb27brLe0Vyhlr7","name":"tutorial_guardia_saludo","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"<=","value":4}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"location":{"enabled":true,"value":{"world":"Lobby","x":9.5,"y":26.2,"z":1.5,"yaw":0.0,"pitch":0.0}},"particle":"CRIT","count":15,"offset":{"x":0.4,"y":0.3,"z":0.4},"speed":0.2,"type":"spawn_particles","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"HiKRkf3hlrHsOaS","name":"tutorial_guardia_espada","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":">=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"<=","value":4}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"sound":{"soundId":{"type":"default","value":"item.armor.equip_iron"},"soundSource":{"type":"self","entryId":"","location":{"world":"","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"yaw":0,"pitch":0}},"track":"MASTER","volume":0.9,"pitch":0.9},"type":"play_sound","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"7XA6qReaun3ztI6","name":"tutorial_espera_titulo_portal","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["snggHrWyzjxXwFm"],"duration":3500,"type":"delayed_action","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"RdHtmHvLUbHdl0n","name":"guardia_abrir_protecciones","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"core-cast menumain_nclaim_click %player_name%","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"name":"lore_guardia_noche","speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Fue una noche sin luna. Bajaron del bosque sin hacer ruido. Corrí a casa y solo encontré la puerta rota. Nara había dejado su muñeca de trapo en la ventana… todavía la llevo conmigo.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"id":"eDwlmSnYOpDw5TR","_genericBlueprint":null},{"name":"lore_guardia_por_que","speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Porque cuando te vi llegar, perdido y sin nada, pensé en Nara. Si ella hubiera despertado sola en un lugar extraño, me gustaría que alguien la hubiera ayudado. Así que aquí estoy.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"id":"ZNn6vLby9A8tu83","_genericBlueprint":null},{"name":"lore_guardia_promesa","speaker":"l5cdUNuqn4sgHAp","text":"Les prometí a Elia y a Nara que, si sobrevivía, protegería a quien lo necesitara. Tú me lo recuerdas cada día. No me hagas romper esa promesa: vuelve siempre de una pieza.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"id":"sT69eFQEBnipksq","_genericBlueprint":null}],"chapter":"talkings.spawn","priority":0,"version":"0.8.0"}